{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Per-consumer usage and health for the paid Higress gateway. Billing truth is the Redis ledger, which ai-quota decrements by input+output tokens 1:1 (hardcoded in v2.2.4 \u2014 there is no weighting option). Per-request detail lives in the gateway.requests fact table. NOTE: an earlier version of this text claimed the access log carries cached_tokens; it does not \u2014 SGLang returns prompt_tokens_details: null, so ai-statistics' input_token_details is always empty.",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this board",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Paid gateway \u2014 `qw38-27b-gw.duckdns.org`.** Series come from the `ai-statistics` wasm plugin, scraped from Envoy on `higress:15090`. Verified against the ledger: a request reporting 54/16/70 tokens moved these counters by exactly 54/16/70 and the Redis balance by 70.\n\nThese are **counters that reset when the gateway container restarts** \u2014 always read them through `rate()` or `increase()`, which handle resets. Raw totals are not a billing figure.\n\n**Not here: each consumer's REMAINING quota.** That lives in `higress-redis` (RESP, not HTTP) and would need a `redis_exporter`. Read it with `curl -H \"Authorization: $ADMIN\" 'https://qw38-27b-gw.duckdns.org/v1/chat/completions/quota?consumer=<name>'`."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Token rate by consumer",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (ai_consumer) (rate(route_upstream_model_consumer_metric_input_token{ai_consumer=~\"$consumer\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{ai_consumer}} input",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (ai_consumer) (rate(route_upstream_model_consumer_metric_output_token{ai_consumer=~\"$consumer\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{ai_consumer}} output",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Tokens/sec. Input and output separately: output costs GPU time, input is largely cache-read."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by consumer",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (ai_consumer) (rate(route_upstream_model_consumer_metric_llm_duration_count{ai_consumer=~\"$consumer\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{ai_consumer}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Billing view \u2014 tokens over the selected range",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "description": "increase() over the dashboard time range, so it is correct across gateway restarts. Set the range to your billing period. cached_tokens is NOT here \u2014 it is per-request and lives in the gateway access log; use it to price cache reads lower than fresh input.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "total"
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": {
            "byField": "ai_consumer",
            "mode": "outer"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Time 1": true,
              "Time 2": true,
              "Time 3": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "input",
              "Value #B": "output",
              "Value #C": "total"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (ai_consumer) (increase(route_upstream_model_consumer_metric_input_token{ai_consumer=~\"$consumer\"}[$__range]))"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (ai_consumer) (increase(route_upstream_model_consumer_metric_output_token{ai_consumer=~\"$consumer\"}[$__range]))"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum by (ai_consumer) (increase(route_upstream_model_consumer_metric_total_token{ai_consumer=~\"$consumer\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
